			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 761830101,
					"content": "Thanks for the invitation, Sandrone. This food tastes just like I remember. It really brings back memories.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761830102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Knave"
				},
				{
					"id": 761830102,
					"content": "You're welcome. If you like, we can get together more often when I'm back in Snezhnaya. It'll be just like the old days.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761830103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Marionette"
				},
				{
					"id": 761830103,
					"content": "Of course.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761830104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Knave"
				},
				{
					"id": 761830104,
					"content": "Speaking of Snezhnaya, how's everything going on your end?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761830105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Marionette"
				},
				{
					"id": 761830105,
					"content": "Her Majesty the Tsaritsa's plans have made some initial progress, but Project Stuzha is proving more difficult to implement than the Mayor anticipated.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761830106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Knave"
				},
				{
					"id": 761830106,
					"content": "Then it appears we'll both be busy from now on.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761830107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Marionette"
				},
				{
					"id": 761830107,
					"content": "Though we should still have time to stop for a cup of tea every now and then, or even catch a performance by the Korolevskiy Troupe.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761830124
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Knave"
				},
				{
					"id": 761830124,
					"content": "Indeed. Though we should still have time to stop for a cup of tea every now and then, or even catch a performance by the Korolevskiy Troupe.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761830108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Knave"
				},
				{
					"id": 761830108,
					"content": "Is Odette still performing ballet?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761830109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Marionette"
				},
				{
					"id": 761830109,
					"content": "Yes. Every time I see her, she seems to keep getting better.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761830110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Knave"
				},
				{
					"id": 761830110,
					"content": "Amazing. I'd love to see her perform again when I'm back.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761830111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Marionette"
				},
				{
					"id": 761830111,
					"content": "I find it really quite fascinating. Despite learning her craft under Rosalyne, their temperaments and styles couldn't be more different.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761830112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Marionette"
				},
				{
					"id": 761830112,
					"content": "That's not necessarily a bad thing.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761830113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Knave"
				},
				{
					"id": 761830113,
					"content": "True... Rosalyne danced with a fiery passion, whereas Odette is as frosty and opaque as a block of solid ice.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761830114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Marionette"
				},
				{
					"id": 761830114,
					"content": "She appears to be carrying a heavy burden.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761830115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Knave"
				},
				{
					"id": 761830115,
					"content": "And yet, when she performs on stage, her movements are so pure, as though her heart were free from even the tiniest of blemishes.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761830116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Marionette"
				},
				{
					"id": 761830116,
					"content": "Or perhaps she's sealed such things away where no one will see them.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761830117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Knave"
				},
				{
					"id": 761830117,
					"content": "Perhaps. In the end, isn't that what ice does — freeze over the cracks? But she's not fragile, she's resolute. If anything, I'd say she's dangerous.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761830118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Marionette"
				},
				{
					"id": 761830118,
					"content": "At least in that regard, she resembles Rosalyne.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761830119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Knave"
				},
				{
					"id": 761830119,
					"content": "Because she's dangerous?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761830120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Marionette"
				},
				{
					"id": 761830120,
					"content": "Because of her resolve.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761830121
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Knave"
				},
				{
					"id": 761830121,
					"content": "I suppose you're right. No wonder there are rumors that she's the favorite to inherit the \"La Signora\" title.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761830122
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Marionette"
				},
				{
					"id": 761830122,
					"content": "Hah... Once we get to know her better, we could invite her to our tea parties. I hope she won't refuse.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761830123
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Marionette"
				},
				{
					"id": 761830123,
					"content": "Me too.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761830124
					],
					"speakerTitle": "The Knave"
				}
			]
		},
